Exercise 2.2 — The expectations sheet
Answer:
Dataset         : customers
Critical fields : email
Required        : email
Key             : email
Allowed values  : email matches '^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$'; and status/active flag ∈ {active, inactive} → campaign only sends to active
Ranges          : last_activity >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL 30 DAY  → defines "active enough"
Cross-table     : -
Cross-field     : -
Freshness       : <= 30 days
Severity        : HIGH
